<html class="djot-viewer"><head><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><title>Highlighting</title><link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2032%2032%22%3E%3Cstyle%3E%40media%20(prefers-color-scheme%3A%20dark)%20%7B%20text%20%7B%20fill%3A%20%23fff%3B%20%7D%20%7D%3C%2Fstyle%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2216%22%20y%3D%2223%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%2CHelvetica%2Csans-serif%22%20font-size%3D%2228%22%20font-weight%3D%22bold%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20fill%3D%22%23000%22%3Edj%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E"></head><body><main class="djot"><section id="Highlighting">
<h1>Highlighting</h1>
<p>A known language:</p>
<pre><code class="language-python hljs"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">greet</span>(<span class="hljs-params">name</span>):
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">f"Hello, <span class="hljs-subst">{name}</span> &lt;&amp;&gt;"</span>
</code></pre>
<p>An unknown language:</p>
<pre><code class="language-nosuchlang">some &lt;code&gt; &amp; text
</code></pre>
<p>No language:</p>
<pre><code>plain &lt;code&gt; &amp; text
</code></pre>
<p>A Mermaid block, which render.js leaves for content.js:</p>
<pre><code class="language-mermaid">graph TD; A--&gt;B
</code></pre>
</section>
</main></body></html>
